Description: Native Wayland & KDE Plasma 6 bi-directional Google Drive sync client
 BearSync (gdrive-sync) is a lightweight, native Linux bi-directional Google
 Drive synchronization client designed for Wayland and KDE Plasma 6.
 .
 Features include:
  - StatusNotifierItem (SNI) system tray integration with scalable SVG badges
  - Native QPalette & FreeDesktop Portal dynamic dark/light & accent theming
  - Linux inotify monitoring with a 3-second write debounce
  - Differential remote polling via Google Drive API v3 changes.list
  - Automatic conflict preservation and custom timestamp file versioning
